note contract 5 fresh, line 127: passing the fresh array to a non-inline call is error 27, even after
note every element is written.
om2
fn g t edit uchar 8 to ulong
ret ulong get t 0
end
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh to ulong
for i ulong 8 unroll
put s i 1
end
ret g s
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 0
putd f a
ret 0
end
